Bow to No One

2
00:11:48,571 --> 00:11:54,571
Mary Queen of Scots is a drama, history film directed by Josie Rourke.

3
00:17:42,857 --> 00:17:48,857
In 1561, Mary Stuart, widow of the King of France, returns to Scotland, reclaims her rightful throne and menaces the
future of Queen Elizabeth I as ruler of England, because she has a legitimate claim to the English throne.

4
00:23:37,142 --> 00:23:43,142
Betrayals, rebellions, conspiracies and their own
life choices imperil both Queens.

5
00:29:31,428 --> 00:29:37,428
They experience the bitter cost of power, until
their tragic fate is finally fulfilled.

6
00:35:25,714 --> 00:35:31,714
Mary Stuart, played by Saoirse Ronan.

7
00:41:20,000 --> 00:41:26,000
Queen Elizabeth I, played by Margot Robbie.

8
00:47:14,285 --> 00:47:20,285
Lord Darnley, played by Jack Lowden.

9
